solution:
**Given:**

The numbers are **{a³ + b³} over {a - b}**, **a² - b² over{a²-ab+b²}**

**Concept used:**

Mean proportion of a and b = sqrt{ab}

**Calculation:**

sqrt{{{a³ + b³} over {a - b}}times{a² - b² over{a²-ab+b²}}}

⇒ sqrt{{{(a + b)(a²-ab+b²)} over {a - b}}times{(a+b)(a-b) over{a²-ab+b²}}}

⇒ sqrt{(a + b)²}

⇒ a + b

**∴ The required answer is a + b.**
